# Palm Incision
sacrament-verb-incise-palm = Make an incision on arm
sacrament-palm-need-arm-targeted = An incision can only be made on an arm or hand. Select an arm in the targeting doll!
sacrament-palm-already-incised = Your palm already bears a fresh bleeding cut!
sacrament-palm-need-sharp-blade = You need to hold a sharp blade to make an incision!
sacrament-palm-incised-success = You slice into your arm with the blade! Hot crimson blood wells from the cut.
sacrament-palm-incised-expired = The blood on your cut has coagulated, sealing over with a dry scab.

# Sorrow Patriarch
sacrament-nutricius-cold-touch = You touch the elder's petrified breast. It is cold as grave marble. Only hot sacrificial blood can thaw this perpetual frost.
sacrament-nutricius-warm-touch = The elder's breast softly pulses with the warmth of your blood. Beads of golden seraphic wax slowly seep from the nipple.
sacrament-nutricius-warmed-user = You press your bleeding cut against the Sorrow Patriarch's petrified breast. Steam hisses from the thawed flesh; the elder exhales deeply with relief as the wax ducts open!
sacrament-nutricius-cooled = The warmth of sacrificial blood has faded. The Patriarch's breast returns to frozen stone.
sacrament-nutricius-is-cold = The Patriarch's nipples are sealed in deathly frost. The wax is frozen solid in the ducts.
sacrament-nutricius-gather-cooldown = The wax has not yet gathered. Wait a moment.
sacrament-nutricius-depleted = The elder's breast has run dry. It needs time for grief to turn to wax once more.
sacrament-nutricius-examined-cold = A colossal grieving elder crouched in perpetual vigil, cradling an infant made of pure wax. His breast is cold as stone. Wax pool: {$pool} of {$max}u.
sacrament-nutricius-examined-warm = The elder's breast exudes the sacred warmth of your blood. The ducts have thawed. Wax pool: {$pool} of {$max}u, cools down in {$seconds}s.
sacrament-nutricius-gather-wax = You fill {THE($container)} with {$amount}u of the Patriarch's sacred wax.
sacrament-nutricius-container-full = {THE($container)} is already full!

# Seraphic Wax Reagent & Treatment
reagent-name-seraphic-wax = Sacred Wax
reagent-desc-seraphic-wax = Thick golden sacred wax weeping from the breast of the Sorrow Patriarch. Undrinkable. Cauterizes bleeding wounds and knits flesh. More severe bleeding consumes more wax.
sacrament-wax-cannot-drink = The sacred wax is far too viscous and scalding to drink! It can only be used to seal bleeding wounds.
sacrament-wax-no-bleeding = The target has no bleeding wounds requiring wax cauterization.
sacrament-wax-not-enough = There is not enough sacred wax in the container to treat wounds.
sacrament-wax-apply-self-stopped = Hot sacred wax sizzles as it completely seals your bleeding wounds! Hemorrhage is stopped and torn flesh knits together.
sacrament-wax-apply-target-stopped = You pour scalding sacred wax over the wounds of {THE($target)}: bleeding is completely stopped and flesh mends!
sacrament-wax-applied-by-other-stopped = {THE($user)} pours scalding sacred wax over your wounds! Bleeding is completely stopped.
sacrament-wax-apply-self-reduced = Hot sacred wax seals part of your wounds, but blood still trickles!
sacrament-wax-apply-target-reduced = You cauterize part of {THE($target)}'s wounds with sacred wax, but wounds still bleed.
sacrament-wax-applied-by-other-reduced = {THE($user)} cauterizes part of your wounds with sacred wax. Bleeding has slowed.

# Sorrow Chalice
sacrament-chalice-examined = A heavy golden chalice crafted to gather and apply sacred wax.

# Smoldering Brand
sacrament-torch-snuff-verb = Extinguish torch
sacrament-torch-light-verb = Ignite torch
sacrament-torch-lit-popup = The resin-soaked torch ignites into a roaring blaze!
sacrament-torch-snuffed-popup = You extinguish the flame of the torch.
sacrament-torch-burned-out = The Smoldering Brand has burned down completely to ash.
sacrament-torch-is-spent = The brand is completely spent; its wick is reduced to cold ash.
sacrament-torch-examined-spent = The torch has burned down completely and cannot be lit again.
sacrament-torch-examined-lit-time = The torch burns with fierce resin fire, dispelling the surrounding gloom. Remaining burn time: {$time}.
sacrament-torch-examined-unlit-time = The torch is extinguished. The charred resin is ready to reignite. Remaining burn time: {$time}.

# Blood Tears Emote
blood-tears-verb-wipe = Wipe blood tears
blood-tears-wipe-popup-self = Blood tears stream from your eyes, and you wipe them away with your hand.
blood-tears-cooldown = You cannot do this again yet.
